@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/employees
@employeeId = 26916c2b-0265-4585-b23d-33d212a44ebb
@slotId = 72b68891-a188-47d5-82dd-9b2117dfe9d2

### 1. Obține orele de lucru pentru un angajat
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}/working-hours
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obține sloturile indisponibile (pentru o dată specifică)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}/unavailable-slots?date=2026-11-20
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obține sloturile indisponibile (pentru un interval from-to)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}/unavailable-slots?from=2026-11-16&to=2026-11-22
Accept: application/json

### 4. Creează un nou slot indisponibil (ex: concediu one-off)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}/unavailable-slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "type": "TIME_OFF",
  "reason": "Concediu medical",
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "start": "09:00:00",
  "end": "17:00:00"
}

### 5. Șterge un slot indisponibil
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{employeeId}}/unvavailable-slots/{{slotId}}